% Who bears a duty: the agent of this role of the action (lomo.le).
the bearer role is addresser.


result annual report 2025 interoperability is identified by "http://example.org/Result_AnnualReport2025_Interoperability".

result annual report 2025 interoperability is an action result.

result annual report 2025 interoperability has the label "First annual report on interoperability in the Union - 2025".

result annual report 2025 interoperability has the comment "https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=COM:2025:860:FIN".


result report 2028 application of regulation is identified by "http://example.org/Result_Report_2028_ApplicationOfRegulation".

result report 2028 application of regulation is an action result.

result report 2028 application of regulation has the label "Report on the application of the Regulation (EU) 2024/1350 due by 12 June 2028".

result report 2028 application of regulation has the comment "Report submitted by the Commission to the European Parliament and the Council on the application of the Regulation, including Article 9(2)(b), Member State contributions, and resettlement and humanitarian admission efforts.".


% The questions of LOMO's requirements document (its competency questions),
% as far as a description can answer them.
query parts is:
    which thing is part of the description.

query kinds is:
    which thing is of the kind which kind.

query bearer is:
    the bearer role is which role.

query prescriptive is:
    which thing is a prescriptive rule.

query constitutive is:
    which thing is a constitutive rule.

query rules_without_conditions is:
    which rule has no written conditions.

query applies is:
    which rule applies to which party.

query texts is:
    which thing is described by the text which text.

query addresses is:
    which thing is identified by which address.

